# BkoTest1All: SticTest1 and HoltTest1All, side by side (the user's suite;
# auto-memory "BkoTest2All / BkoTest1All", docs/design/batch.md §3.4).  The
# spread rehearsal of §11.4: stic1 and the ht1 queues share the hosts, and the
# queues grow onto the holt pools stic1 frees.
# stic1 must name a round directory (drive.py): it stays pinned.
